                        "Details": {
                            "JobSummary": "Psychology Program Manager - Post Traumatic Stress Disorder Clinical Team (PCT). The incumbent of this position will work for the Central Virginia VA Health Care System in Richmond, Virginia, and is a direct report to the Mental Health Service Line. As the Program Manager for the Post Traumatic Stress Disorder Clinical Team (PCT), the incumbent manages and supervises complex programmatic services that include Post Traumatic Stress Disorder (PTSD) Program and other programs.",
