                    "UserArea": {
                        "Details": {
                            "JobSummary": "This position is located in the Mental Health Service at the Albany VA Medical Center in Albany, New York. The Staff Psychologist functions as part of the outpatient general mental health clinic (Behavioral Health Interdisciplinary Program - BHIP). The Psychologist provides a variety of treatment modalities in an Outpatient Clinic that meets the diverse needs of Veterans including management of Post\u00ad Traumatic Stress Disorder (PTSD).",
