                    "UserArea": {
                        "Details": {
                            "JobSummary": "The Senior Psychology Program Manager is expected to be a nationally recognized content expert in at least one topic area in behavioral health such as diagnostic or treatment methods, special mental health populations, or service delivery approaches. The psychologist will be expected to-serve on major committees and develop educational work products that guide practice patterns at local, VISN, and national levels.",
