                    "UserArea": {
                        "Details": {
                            "JobSummary": "This position is located in the Production Service Design and Development Division, Office of Consular Systems and Technology Division, Bureau of Consular Affairs (CA/CST/PSDD). PSDD is responsible for providing software development and maintenance, project management, and contract oversight support for production software applications that support CA\u2019s mission.",
