suite of tools Knowledge of industry threat models such as MITRE's ATT&CK or Lockheed Martin's Cyber Kill Chain Knowledge of common reconnaissance, exploitation, and post-exploitation frameworks Knowledge of networking fundamentals at all OSI layers Experience in red teaming or pen-testing Any of the following certifications: Certified Ethical Hacker Certified Penetration Tester OSCE GXPN GWAPT eWPTX ECPTX",
