                            "MajorDuties": [
                                "You will be responsible for supporting the development and fielding of applications for the Digital Precision Strike Suite group.",
                                "You will conduct tests, document defect status, and review derived requirements and verification methods.",
                                "You will develop software test documentation and procedures by developing automated and manual test cases.",
