                        "Details": {
                            "JobSummary": "About the Position: This position is at DEVCOM AvMC Center Staff (CS) Directorate US Army Combat Capabilities Dev Cmd, Aviation and Missile Center located at Redstone Arsenal, AL. Renewable Terms are eligible to apply for this position in accordance with P.L. 115-232, Section 1112. Please make sure your supporting SF-50 reflects this remark.",
