                            "MajorDuties": [
                                "Primary technical point of contact to support the planning, design, implementation, and sustainment of Enterprise Business Applications leveraged to enable business operations.",
                                "Responsible for the technical direction, planning and execution, milestone development, scheduling, and budgeting for software application development and application modernization initiatives for the Center.",
                                "Responsible for software application documentation including Defense Information Systems Agency application security and development Security Technical Implementation Guide checklists, Standard Operating Procedures, and User guides.",
                                "Advise Leadership in meetings with senior personnel from Combat Capabilities Development Command (DEVCOM) Aviation and Missile Center (AvMC), stakeholders, customers, other DoD services, academia, and industry."
