                    "UserArea": {
                        "Details": {
                            "JobSummary": "THIS IS AN ARIZONA NATIONAL GUARD TITLE 5 EXCEPTED SERVICE POSITION This position is in the Excepted Service \"under the authority of Title V, P.L. 114-328, Sections 932 and 1084 (FY17 NDAA). This position is part of the AZ G6, Arizona National Guard under Position Description Number PDT5710500.",
