                            "JobSummary": "The Department of Homeland Security (DHS) is recruiting professionals to support a range of technical roles in Cybersecurity Risk Management and Compliance including, Cybersecurity Risk Management Analyst, Cybersecurity Policy Analyst, Technical Support Specialist, and Cybersecurity Supply Chain Risk Management Expert. All positions are in the DHS Cybersecurity Service.",
