                    "UserArea": {
                        "Details": {
                            "JobSummary": "The Department of Homeland Security (DHS) is recruiting professionals to support a range of leadership roles in Cybersecurity Risk Management and Compliance, including Cybersecurity Risk Management Lead, Cybersecurity Governance Team Lead, Senior Risk and Compliance Program Manager, Cybersecurity Risk Consultant, Risk Assessment and Compliance Manager. All positions are in the DHS Cybersecurity Service.",
