                                "Duties described below reflect the full performance level GS-11. Duties assigned to an entry grade of GS-7 or GS-9 will be developmental in nature.",
                                "Analyzes, plans, and evaluates directorate functions to determine validity, propriety, accuracy, and adequacy of work processes.",
                                "Confers with personnel at all levels; observes operating practices; and accomplishes any other tasks deemed essential to performance of related duties.",
