                            "AgencyMarketingStatement": "DFAS takes pride in serving the men and women who defend America. We are seeking goal-oriented people who like a challenge and care about serving our country. We offer rewarding careers in finance, accounting, information systems, contracting services, human resources, clerical work and many other areas.",
