                            "JobSummary": "The Chief Strategy Office (CSO), Chief Data and Artificial Intelligence Office (CDAO), seeks a Management and Program Analyst/Data Analyst to provide support to the CDAO implementation of the DCSA Data, Analytics, and AI Strategy. The incumbent identifies, defines, analyzes, and provides recommendations for how information and data assets aid strategies and business operating models, optimizing data and information technology investment to achieve mission and business outcomes.",
