n Congress (IFSAC), or the Fire Service Professional Qualifications System (PRO-Board) within 24 months of employment: Driver Operator Mobile Water Supply Driver Operator Aerial Fire Inspector II Fire Officer II Hazmat Incident Commander Incident Safety Officer Public and Life Safety Educator Plans Examiner",
