                            "MajorDuties": [
                                "Serves as a Project Manager for construction, and repair projects for all phases of a project, from predesign to construction phase",
                                "Determines requirements, authors Scope of Work (SOW) or Performance Work Statements (PWS), Independent Government Estimates (IGE), and other contract support documents.",
                                "Administers contracts for a variety of procurement vehicles as well as service contracts.",
                                "Coordinates construction operations with using activities, other contractors, and installation organizations to avoid any unnecessary interruption of work."
