                            "JobSummary": "THIS IS A NATIONAL GUARD TITLE 5 EXCEPTED SERVICE POSITION. This National Guard position is for a DEPUTY FINANCIAL MANAGER, Position Description Number T5134000 and is part of the WI USPFO, works at JFHQ in Madison, Wisconsin National Guard.",
