                            "JobSummary": "The Financial Management Specialist position within the Closeout Coordination Branch (CCB) of the Grant Programs Directorate serves as an advisor to staff on the evaluation of productivity and efficiency of agency programs. The ideal candidate will have experience in financial management or financial analysis, and experience with analyzing and interpreting data for senior management. Apply for this exciting opportunity to become a member of the Grant Programs Directorate team within FEMA.",
