                        "Details": {
                            "JobSummary": "About the Position: Serve as the Program Analyst and advisor to management and staff of the Readiness and Contingency Operations (RCO) office and as staff liaison for the Director, Resource Management (DRM) in support of integrated financial management needs for the RCO operating programs. Management may select at the GS-11 or GS-12 grade level. Full performance grade level of the position is GS-12.",
