                        "Details": {
                            "JobSummary": "THIS IS A NATIONAL GUARD TITLE 5 EXCEPTED SERVICE POSITION. This National Guard position is for a FINANCIAL MANAGER, Position Description Number T5133000 and is part of the CO USPFO, National Guard. The primary purpose of this position is to serve as the Chief Financial Officer (FM) for the state Army National Guard (ARNG).",
