                            "JobSummary": "About the Position: Must be able to satisfy the requirements of the 26JUL12 DODI 1400.25 V1230, DoD Civilian Personnel Management System: Employment in Foreign Areas and Employee Return Rights. Serve as Chief, Finance and Accounting Branch, Resource Management Office, US Army Corp of Engineer, Far East District.",
