                        "Details": {
                            "JobSummary": "THIS IS A NATIONAL GUARD TITLE 5 EXCEPTED SERVICE POSITION. This National Guard position is for a Base Services Specialist, Position Description Number T5900800 and is part of the 158th Force Support Squadron Services Flight of the Vermont Air National Guard.",
                            "WhoMayApply": {
