                            "DetailStatusUrl": "https://apply.usastaffing.gov/Application/ApplicationStatus",
                            "MajorDuties": [
                                "Serve as a senior Information Technology (IT) Program Manager (DATAMGT/SYSADMIN) and Technical Advisor.",
                                "Advise the Chief and the Deputy on the development, management and operational direction of IT programs.",
                                "Perform data analysis of financial data within agency systems.",
