                        "Details": {
                            "JobSummary": "This is a Direct Hire Authority (DHA) solicitation utilizing the DHA for Certain Personnel of the DoD Workforce to recruit and appoint qualified candidates to positions in the competitive service. About the Position: This position is located with the OFFICE OF THE DEPUTY CHIEF OF STAFF, G-6, IT PLANNING & PROG DIVISION, Arlington, VA.",
