                            "DetailStatusUrl": "https://apply.usastaffing.gov/Application/ApplicationStatus",
                            "MajorDuties": [
                                "You will provide administrative program direction.",
                                "You will serve as principal advisor to the Shipyard Commander, participating in top management discussions, decisions, and policymaking.",
                                "You will participate in the development and implementation of long and short-term policies and plans, goals, and objectives for the shipyard.",
                                "You will develop solutions fo complex shipyard support issues and present recommendations to the shipyard commander.",
                                "You will exercise fiscal management for the Executive Support Office by monitoring expenditures and reallocating funds based on shifting program needs.",
                                "You will monitor financial reporting for conformance with shipyard objectives and requirements.",
                                "You will approve long and short-range work plans, manage organizational and program changes, and exercise discretionary authority to approve and distribute funds of the departments budget."
